      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor actively identified the specific misconception (stool routine/application vs. colonoscopy/pathology), explained the difference in plain language, and redirected tracking to genuine pending items (gynecology pathology and follow-up). The family received and actioned the corrected distinction by calling the nurse station and planning to merge stool follow-up with gynecology visit. This goes beyond merely avoiding hallucination (RC3) or basic information reconciliation (RC2).",
