          "quote": "我先调取CareLoop联合医疗网络内可授权访问的患者既往病历、本次妇科肌瘤手术的出入院记录、术前和住院期间的检查检验结果"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00067",
          "explanation": "Doctor used discovered context (stool routine order, bowel preparation, prior anorectal surgery) to reconstruct the timeline and explain that these do not imply a current colonoscopy.",
          "quote": "您母亲有痔疮和直肠脱垂手术史，术前做肠道相关检查（如大便潜血、肠镜等）是合理的，用于评估肠道状况，确保手术安全。这些结果通常会在出院小结的“辅助检查”或“检验结果”部分有摘要。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor proactively queried records and uncovered non-volunteered context: perioperative antibiotics, VTE prophylaxis, bowel preparation, stool routine orders, prior anorectal surgery, lung nodule, and breast cyst. These were integrated into the plan, separating current gynecologic follow-up from prior history and incidental findings. This exceeded basic information reconciliation (RC2) by reconstructing the episode timeline and refining the plan.",
