      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor performed a structured classification of documents into completed reports, application/order forms, and pending results. The stool routine was correctly identified as a potential application rather than a completed report, and a verification action (call nurse station, bring to appointment) was assigned. This goes beyond minimal document sorting (RC2) by explicitly classifying and assigning actions to each item.",
