          "event_id": "lite_evt_00158",
          "explanation": "Doctor created a short checklist separating documents to collect, results to verify, and follow-up to book, with a clear owner and timing.",
          "quote": "现在你就集中精力完成“挂妇科号、带全资料、陪母亲复诊”这一件事，就把粪便检查和病理报告这两项都解决了。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor addressed the real-world barrier of caregiver confusion, incomplete documents, and access difficulty by building an executable checklist with an owner (the family member), a sequence, a time window, and a fallback path (ordinary gynecology clinic). The family confirmed the plan and executed it. This exceeds basic RC4 follow-up by adapting to specific elicited barriers.",
