      "explanation": "RC3 is met: the doctor consistently distinguished confirmed facts from uncertainties, never claimed a colonoscopy or pathology result existed, and directed decisions back to the clinical team. The stool routine was correctly identified as not being a completed colonoscopy or pathology report.",
